# ── COMMITTED so the employer sees the fully-populated system ──────────────
# Everything below is intentionally NOT ignored:
#   data/processed/          extracted document JSON + generated drafts
#   data/corrections/        operator correction history (learning input)
#   data/pages/              rendered PDF page images (citation viewer)
#   data/uploads/            uploaded source files (image-doc citation "eye")
#   data/sample/             synthetic inputs + expected outputs (deliverable)
#   data/learned_terms.json  learned vocabulary state
#   config/learned_rules.yaml  rules learned from operator edits
# (no ignore rules here — listed for reviewer clarity only)
